// Side special (the reference's): in the air, the first use since the fighter was last on the ground, caught a ledge or was
// hit stops its fall and lifts it by 0.3 reference units a frame (once per airtime: flag 0). Later uses keep their fall, slowed by
// the move's own light pull. A jump's rise is not kept (sim 143, owner decision 102: with the move's pull of 0.031 a kept rise
// floated the fighter 20 to 58 units over the jump [E: the reference's "vertical speed added" read as added to a fall]).
if frame == 1 && grounded == 0 {
    if air_flag(0) == 0 {
        set_air_flag(0);
        add_vel(0, 0.0375 - vy);
    } else {
        add_vel(0, -max(vy, 0));
    }
}
